# Stranglethorn Vale, Alliance ~34 to ~36: the first half of the consensus
# Stranglethorn visit (34.2-37.8). Flow: Nesingwary's Expedition (the first
# hunting tiers) > Rebel Camp and Kurzen's Compound (Bookie Herod) >
# Nesingwary again > Booty Bay (flight path, bind) > the west coast (Bloodscalp
# trolls, crocolisks, the Crystalvein Mine) > back north to pick up the
# Green Hills of Stranglethorn and the Rebel Camp's Kurzen quests, which the
# next guide (05-stranglethorn-vale) finishes.
#
# Optional: Crystal in the Mountains starts from the Pendant of Myzrael, a
# drop of Gluggle, a rare murloc: take it if he drops it.
# Deviations: none in the quest set. Hemet Nesingwary (5762) is carried from
# Thousand Needles; characters without it skip the turn-in.
guide forever/alliance/30-40/04-stranglethorn-vale
title Stranglethorn Vale
faction Alliance
levels 34-36
zone Stranglethorn Vale
next forever/alliance/30-40/05-stranglethorn-vale

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Nesingwary's Expedition

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  tip From Duskwood take the road south into Stranglethorn; the hunters' tents stand just west of the road past the Rebel Camp turn-off.
  accept 583                          -- Barnil Stonepot
  turnin 583                          -- Hemet Nesingwary
  turnin 5762                         -- Hemet Nesingwary, from Thousand Needles
  accept 194
  accept 185                          -- Ajeck Rouack
  accept 190                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin

step Young tigers and panthers
  tip Both roam the grass around the camp and along the road north.
  kill 681 quest 185                  -- Young Stranglethorn Tiger
  kill 683 quest 190                  -- Young Panther

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  turnin 185                          -- Ajeck Rouack
  accept 186
  turnin 190                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin
  accept 191

step Stranglethorn Tigers
  tip The adult tigers prowl the hills just south and west of the camp.
  kill 682 quest 186                  -- Stranglethorn Tiger

step Ajeck Rouack
  turnin 186
  accept 187                          -- The elder tigers come later, on the way back from the Rebel Camp

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Rebel Camp

step Rebel Camp
  tip Take the road north; Private Thorsen stands on it, the camp sits in the hills to the west.
  accept 215                          -- Private Thorsen
  turnin 215                          -- Lieutenant Doren, in the hut
  accept 200
  accept 203                          -- Sergeant Yohwa
  accept 204

step Kurzen's Compound
  tip The Kurzen rebels hold the camp east of the Rebel Camp; work its outer edge, where Jungle Fighters and Medicine Men stand, and loot the supply crates by the tents.
  kill 937 quest 203                  -- Kurzen Jungle Fighter
  collect 2633 quest 204.1            -- Jungle Remedy
  collect 2634 quest 204.2            -- Venom Fern Extract, from a Kurzen Supplies crate

step Bookie Herod
  tip Herod's records lie in a hut on the compound's west side; his strongbox sits farther east, by the cave mouth.
  turnin 200                          -- Bookie Herod's Records
  accept 328
  turnin 328                          -- Bookie Herod's Strongbox
  accept 329

step Rebel Camp
  turnin 203                          -- Sergeant Yohwa
  turnin 204
  turnin 329                          -- Lieutenant Doren
  accept 330
  turnin 330                          -- Corporal Sethman
  accept 331
  turnin 331                          -- Lieutenant Doren

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Nesingwary's hunts

step Panthers, raptors and elder tigers
  tip Back south past Nesingwary: Panthers and Stranglethorn Raptors run in the clearings west of the camp toward the coast; the elder tigers hold the hills south-west.
  kill 736 quest 191                  -- Panther
  kill 685 quest 194                  -- Stranglethorn Raptor
  kill 1085 quest 187                 -- Elder Stranglethorn Tiger
  accept 635 optional                 -- Gluggle, a rare murloc on the coast west of camp, drops the Pendant of Myzrael: take it if you meet him

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  turnin 194                          -- Hemet Nesingwary
  accept 195
  turnin 187                          -- Ajeck Rouack
  accept 188
  turnin 191                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin

step Sin'Dall and the Lashtail raptors
  tip Sin'Dall, the great tiger, lairs on the hilltop south-west of the camp; Lashtail Raptors run south of it, along the way to Booty Bay.
  collect 3879 quest 188              -- Paw of Sin'Dall
  kill 686 quest 195                  -- Lashtail Raptor

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Booty Bay

step Down to Booty Bay
  tip Follow the main road south the length of the jungle, past the Grom'gol turn-off, to Booty Bay on the southern cape.
  getfp "Booty Bay"                   -- Gyll, on the top floor by the docks
  sethome "Booty Bay"                 -- Innkeeper Skindle, The Salty Sailor Tavern
  accept 575                          -- Drizzlik, by the bank
  accept 605                          -- Crank Fizzlebub
  accept 198                          -- Krazek, in the tavern
  accept 201
  accept 189                          -- Kebok, in the tavern
  vendor nearest

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The jungle loop

step Crystalvein Mine
  tip Walk back north; the Crystalvein Mine lies west of the road in the middle of the jungle. The Crystal Spine Basilisks there drop the shards.
  collect 3918 quest 605              -- Singing Crystal Shard

step Bloodscalp trolls
  tip The Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins on the coast west of Nesingwary's camp.
  collect 1519 quest 189              -- Bloodscalp Ear

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  turnin 195                          -- Hemet Nesingwary
  turnin 188                          -- Ajeck Rouack
  complete 201                        -- Investigate the Camp: just look around the hunters' camp

step Private Thorsen
  tip Thorsen patrols the road north of camp, toward the Rebel Camp.
  turnin 198

step River crocolisks
  tip River Crocolisks swim the river by the Rebel Camp.
  collect 4053 quest 575              -- Large River Crocolisk Skin

step Booty Bay
  hearth "Booty Bay"
  turnin 575                          -- Drizzlik
  accept 577
  turnin 605                          -- Crank Fizzlebub
  turnin 201                          -- Krazek
  turnin 189                          -- Kebok

step Snapjaw Crocolisks
  tip Snapjaw Crocolisks bask on the shore and islands along the coast north of Booty Bay.
  collect 4104 quest 577              -- Snapjaw Crocolisk Skin

step Booty Bay
  turnin 577                          -- Drizzlik
  accept 213                          -- Kebok
  accept 616                          -- Krazek
  turnin 616                          -- Baron Revilgaz, upstairs in the tavern
  accept 578

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North again

step The haunted island
  tip Follow the west coast north; the haunted island lies off the shore west of Nesingwary's camp. Just reach it.
  complete 578

step Nesingwary's Expedition
  tip Barnil collects the Green Hills of Stranglethorn: the pages drop from almost every humanoid in the jungle. Turn the pages into chapters as you go.
  accept 192                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin
  accept 338                          -- Barnil Stonepot
  accept 339
  accept 340
  accept 341
  accept 342

step Rebel Camp
  accept 207                          -- Brother Nimetz
  accept 574                          -- Sergeant Yohwa
